<title>USA: NYC $120 mln taxable bonds won by Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>NYC $120 mln taxable bonds won by Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York City officials said Wednesday that Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. won $120 million taxable city bonds with a true interest cost of 7.349221 percent.</p>
</text>
